The implementation plan involves setting up a new Lumen project, configuring the environment for SQLite, creating the necessary database schema for merchants and wares, and defining API routes for registration, login, wares upload, and retrieval. Controllers will be created to handle the logic for each route, with input validation and error handling implemented to ensure data integrity and security. The application will also render wares in HTML format for the retrieval endpoint.

